Subject: add missing deps for libasn1util-private-samba.so
From: Michael Tokarev <mjt@tls.msk.ru>
Date: Wed, 09 Sep 2026 23:45:58 +0300

libasn1util uses at least 2 private libs but does not list
them as dependencies, so does not inherit private library
path in RPATH, so dpkg-shlibdeps complains:

error: cannot find library libgenrand-private-samba.so.0 needed by \
 debian/samba-libs/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/samba/libasn1util-private-samba.so.0 \
 (ELF format: 'elf64-x86-64' abi: 'ELF:64:l:amd64:0'; RPATH: '')

diff --git a/lib/util/wscript_build b/lib/util/wscript_build
--- a/lib/util/wscript_build
+++ b/lib/util/wscript_build
@@ -252,5 +252,5 @@ else:
     bld.SAMBA_LIBRARY('asn1util',
                       source='asn1.c',
-                      deps='talloc samba-util',
+                      deps='talloc samba-util genrand samba-debug',
                       private_library=True,
                       local_include=False)
